      "id": "claim_69bb074acae84df09b79249d6ce7cff4",
      "statement": "main.py is a FastAPI app that adds CORSMiddleware with allow_origins pinned to the single origin http://localhost:3000, allow_methods=[\"*\"], and allow_headers=[\"*\"]; this origin matches the Next.js dev server and the frontend's hard-coded fetch target of http://localhost:8000/agent, so the CORS origin and the frontend fetch URL are a matched pair that must change together.",
